  "answer": "Hooks are registered through RequestHooksMixin.register_hook in models.py. A callable hook is appended to the list for the specified event; an iterable of hooks is extended into that list. During a request, session-level and request-level hooks are merged by merge_hooks, then dispatch_hook looks up the event and invokes each hook in order. A hook may return replacement hook data; returning None leaves the current data unchanged. Hooks can be removed with deregister_hook, which removes the matching hook from the event list.",
